  "description": "Running sheets the bone of the blade on the back builds the weight capacity up to 350lbs, strength, and solidness. High around and low in the center with empty openings configuration forestalls water and residue amassing viably.\nFeatures\nEasy access. If you own a raised vehicle such as an SUV, Jeep, or truck, then it’s imperative to install running boards. Not only do they make it easier for you to get on and off your vehicle, but their lower steps also help to provide some boost to kids and elderly passengers who might be having some mobility issues.\nProtection Against Debris. When you are driving, car tires often shoot various road debris (such as small rocks, gravel and nails) onto the side panels and windows of the car. At this time, the running boards will protect your body and reduce scratches.\nKeep Interior Clean. passengers can step on running boards and wipe dirt off their feet before getting on.\nEnhances Appearance. Running boards are among the few aftermarket accessories that completely transform the appearance of your truck. with a set for both sides, your truck will have a whole new look that will catch the attention and the eyes of any car enthusiast.\nResale value. Running boards can help to increase your truck’s resale value, which will actually improve your chances of landing a willing buyer.\n1-year Warranty. For your Safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2007-2018 Chevy Silverado/GMC Sierra 1500.\nCompatible with 2007-2019 Silverado/Sierra 2500HD 3500HD Crew Cab, Including 19 1500 LD.\nFits to Gas engine Only",
